      "title": "LATENTVIEW: Inorganic Expansion Plans And Margin Outlook Will Drive Further Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their fair value estimate for Latent View Analytics from ₹416 to about ₹404.75, reflecting updated views on slightly lower revenue growth expectations, a higher profit margin outlook and a modestly reduced forward P/E assumption. What's in the News Latent View Analytics is assessing acquisition opportunities, with management highlighting interest in firms that have strong professional services partnerships with Databricks, as discussed on the company’s Fourth Quarter Fiscal Year 2026 earnings call.",
